(Sheldon:)Oh...

4
00:00:14,663 --> 00:00:16,663
(Howard(entering, wearing an eye patch):)Hello, boys.

5
00:00:17,083 --> 00:00:19,503
(Leonard:)Ahoy, matey.

6
00:00:19,752 --> 00:00:21,502
(Howard:)Noticed the eye patch, did you?

7
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:25,170
(Howard:)It's all part of a technique
I've been studying for picking up women.

8
00:00:25,341 --> 00:00:27,221
(Howard:)You employ a visual display...

9
00:00:27,384 --> 00:00:32,094
(Howard:)...designed to make yourself
distinctive and memorable.

10
00:00:32,264 --> 00:00:34,974
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes, like the male peacock
with brilliant plumage...

11
00:00:35,142 --> 00:00:38,352
(Sheldon:)...or the rutting baboon
with engorged hindquarters.

12
00:00:39,063 --> 00:00:42,193
(Leonard:)Or in this case,
the bar mitzvah boy with pink eye.

13
00:00:42,942 --> 00:00:45,072
(Howard:)Mock me if you will, but it works.

14
00:00:45,236 --> 00:00:47,066
You show up in something distinctive...

15
00:00:47,238 --> 00:00:49,448
(Howard:)...scope out your target
and toss out some negs.

16
00:00:49,615 --> 00:00:52,285
- What are negs?
- A neg is a negative compliment...

17
00:00:52,451 --> 00:00:55,041
(Howard:)...that throws a pretty woman
off her game, like:

